## 9. Hosted Orchard service and payment

<span id="hosted"></span>The hosted Orchard service (the "Hosted Service") is an optional, paid service in which we run
Orchard connectors ("workers") for your organisation on infrastructure provided by Fly.io and make
them reachable over HTTPS. It is described at [/products/orchard/hosted](/products/orchard/hosted).

**Accounts.** You need an Orchard account to use the Hosted Service. Accounts are provided through
our sign-in provider, WorkOS. When you first sign in we create a personal workspace for you, which
owns your deployments and billing; its members can query its deployments. You are responsible for
activity under your account and your workspace, and for keeping access to your email account secure. You must give accurate account and billing information.

**Requests and provisioning.** Deployments and changes to them (creating, scaling and stopping) are
