paid on the Orchard. We may change fees by updating that page; changes apply to usage from the date
they are published, and Fly.io price changes flow through at the same markup. Fees exclude taxes,
which you are responsible for where they apply.

**Payment.** Payments are processed by Stripe. By setting up billing you authorise us, through Stripe,
to charge your payment method for fees as they are invoiced, normally monthly in arrears. If a payment
fails we may suspend or stop your deployments after notice. Usage figures shown in the console are
